# Always LF, in the repository and in the working tree. With core.autocrlf on Windows, CRLF files looked
# unformatted to gofmt and every commit warned "LF will be replaced by CRLF"; CI (Linux) and local checkouts
# now see the same bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files (never converted)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
